{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfbeSm7rnnUbCxpdFwyWu", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`git rebase --onto` lets you choose exactly which commits to move and where to put them. A plain `git rebase <base>` always replays everything since the merge-base onto `<base>`. `--onto` lets you cut the range somewhere else.\n\n## Syntax\n\n```\ngit rebase --onto <newbase> <upstream> [<branch>]\n```\n\nThis takes the commits in `<upstream>..<branch>` (in `<branch>` but not in `<upstream>`) and replays them on top of `<newbase>`. `<branch>` defaults to the current branch.\n\n## Example: moving a branch off another feature branch\n\nYou branched `feature-b` from `feature-a` by mistake. It should have come from `main`:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B\n                 \\\nfeature-a:        C---D\n                       \\\nfeature-b:              E---F\n```\n\nYou only want `E` and `F` on `main`, not `C` and `D`:\n\n```bash\ngit rebase --onto main feature-a feature-b\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B\n                |\\\nfeature-a:      | C---D\n                 \\\nfeature-b:        E'---F'\n```\n\nGit took the commits in `feature-a..feature-b` (`E` and `F`) and replayed them onto `main`. `E'` and `F'` are new commits with new hashes.\n\n## Other common uses\n\n- **Drop commits from the middle of a branch.** To remove `C` and `D` from `A-B-C-D-E-F`:\n  ```bash\n  git rebase --onto B D\n  ```\n  This replays everything after `D` (`E` and `F`) onto `B`.\n- **Recover after an upstream branch was rewritten.** If `feature-a` was rebased or squashed and `feature-b` still sits on the old commits, run `git rebase --onto feature-a <old-feature-a-sha> feature-b`.\n\n## Caveats\n\n- It rewrites history, so be careful with branches other people have already pulled.\n- If something goes wrong, `git rebase --abort` stops a rebase that's in progress. After it finishes, `git reflog` lets you get back to the original commits."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 7217, "cache_read_input_tokens": 16780, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 7217}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "066197b3-ce54-459d-9c40-1d70222ef4da", "uuid": "316e3871-f5fe-4857-b5ee-6782f9195f65", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T14:06:45.649Z", "request_id": "req_011CfbeSkn21Pb2r2W4Kivtm"}
